      "created_at": "2013-05-15T14:08:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Does anyone know what the deal is with that <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/VqDddcI.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">first ship shown on the U.F.G.D. Kicstarter update</a>? &nbsp;It's a ship... with some kind of grey scoops off to the side. &nbsp;I have no idea what to make of it. &nbsp;Anyone have any ideas?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
