      "created_at": "2013-05-15T16:00:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Actually, those are heavy-duty shields! That ship is designed to be pretty much invulnerable on one side and heavily armed on the other so it can lock on to another ship and circle strafe around it, bathing its target in obscene amounts of cannon-fire while being protected from any outside threats.</p>",
