      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-15T16:35:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Two of those, side-by-side, can cruise through virtually any field of fire or blast their way through nearly any fortification… Fun stuff!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"></p>\n<p>(The dragon and technovores would still eat them for lunch, though.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> )</p>\n<p>I love that there are small bits of damage on the front of the ship. Great detail on these images!</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:39:57.791Z",
